1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,312
Your customers now buy integrated solutions.

2
00:00:03,372 --> 00:00:06,222
But decades of autonomy built leaders for silos.

3
00:00:06,281 --> 00:00:07,231
That is the gap.

4
00:00:08,031 --> 00:00:10,362
Enterprise leadership is not a job title.

5
00:00:10,419 --> 00:00:16,274
A leader may run a single unit, and still decide for the economic and social welfare of the whole firm.

6
00:00:17,174 --> 00:00:17,940
First, focus.

7
00:00:17,999 --> 00:00:21,534
Complexity pulls attention inward, to structure and process.

8
00:00:21,593 --> 00:00:27,898
Enterprise leaders prioritize ruthlessly, and keep only what creates differentiated value for the customer.

9
00:00:28,798 --> 00:00:29,613
Second, build.

10
00:00:29,672 --> 00:00:37,186
Enterprise leaders develop strategic competence, what the firm can do, and organizational character, who it is, at the same time.

11
00:00:38,086 --> 00:00:39,086
Third, reconcile.

12
00:00:39,145 --> 00:00:40,322
Cost against growth.

13
00:00:40,381 --> 00:00:42,147
Stability against reinvention.

14
00:00:42,206 --> 00:00:47,267
Enterprise leaders look at their own company as a stranger would, and hold both sides.

15
00:00:48,167 --> 00:00:48,986
Fourth, align.

16
00:00:49,044 --> 00:00:51,266
Meaning: a shared reason to integrate.

17
00:00:51,325 --> 00:00:53,839
Mind-set: the beliefs people bring to work.

18
00:00:53,898 --> 00:00:57,114
Mobilization: processes that move people and resources.

19
00:00:57,173 --> 00:00:59,746
Measurement: what gets counted and rewarded.

20
00:00:59,804 --> 00:01:03,079
And mechanisms for renewal, so the system never settles.

21
00:01:04,679 --> 00:01:06,642
Yet it remains an unnatural act.

22
00:01:06,704 --> 00:01:12,778
Cultures celebrate unit heroes, frameworks reward isolated expertise, and pay follows unit results.

23
00:01:13,578 --> 00:01:14,963
So build them on purpose.

24
00:01:15,019 --> 00:01:18,122
Demand an enterprise view, and measure it, from the top.

25
00:01:18,177 --> 00:01:20,338
Rotate high potentials across the firm.

26
00:01:20,393 --> 00:01:21,834
Track talent across silos.

27
00:01:23,034 --> 00:01:25,886
Integrated solutions need leaders who act for the whole.
